168:     /**
169:      * Override setBounds to keep shapes looking right.
170:      * The classifier and state Figs are nicely centered vertically, 
171:      * and stretched out over the full width, 
172:      * to allow easy selection with the mouse.
173:      * The Fig can only be shrinked to half its original size - so that 
174:      * it is not reduceable to a few pixels only.
