252:         // Where we now have no stereotype, mark as not displayed. Were we do
253:         // have a stereotype, set the text and mark as displayed. If we remove
254:         // or add/change a stereotype we adjust the vertical bounds
255:         // appropriately. Otherwise we need not work out the bounds here. That
