47: /**
48:  * A Mode to interpret user input while creating a comment edge.
49:  * The comment can connect an existing comment node to any other existing
50:  * If the association is an n-ary association (diamond shape node) then
51:  * the edge is simply added.
52:  * If the association is a binary association edge then that edge is
53:  * transformed into a n-ary association.
54:  *
55:  * @author pepargouml@yahoo.es
56:  */
57: public class ModeCreateCommentEdge extends ModeCreatePolyEdge {
58:     
