146:     /**   
147:      * This method creates a project from the specified URL
148:      *
149:      * Unlike the constructor which forces an .argo extension This
150:      * method will attempt to load a raw XMI file
151:      * 
152:      * This method can fail in several different ways. Either by
153:      * throwing an exception or by having the
154:      * ArgoParser.SINGLETON.getLastLoadStatus() set to not true.
155:      * 
156:      * @param url The URL to load the project from.
157:      * @return The newly loaded project.
158:      * @throws OpenException if the file can not be opened
159:      *
