73: /**
74:  * The TabDiagram is the tab in the multieditorpane that holds a diagram. The 
75:  * TabDiagram consists of a JGraph (with the figs) and a toolbar. It is possible
76:  * to spawn objects of this class into a dialog via the spawn method of its
77:  * parent.
78:  */
79: public class TabDiagram
80:     extends TabSpawnable
81:     implements TabModelTarget, GraphSelectionListener, ModeChangeListener {
82: 
83:     private static final Logger LOG = Logger.getLogger(TabDiagram.class);
84: 
