42: /**
43:  * Presentation logic which is common to both an operations
44:  * compartment and an attributes compartment.<p>
45:  *
46:  * TODO: This is really just a generic list compartment.  It doesn't have
47:  * any behavior specific to features.  Rename to something more appropriate and
